  "stillBetterFit": {
    "heading": "When Ramp Is Still the Better Fit",
    "body": "Ramp remains the stronger choice for businesses that want an all-in-one corporate card, spend management and accounts payable platform with no mandatory monthly subscription fees. Ramp Free costs $0 per user per month and provides unlimited corporate cards, travel and expense tracking, budgets and reporting, invoice creation, and accounts receivable tools. It also integrates with QuickBooks Online and Xero at no extra charge.\n\nRamp Bill Pay includes free wires and same-day ACH transfers, allowing finance teams to pay vendor invoices by ACH, card, check or wire without paying the $0.59 or $1.99 per-transaction fees listed by BILL. On the cash management side, Ramp lists a footnoted 4.61% variable yield in a Ramp Investment Account with zero fees, no minimum deposits and no transfer caps, alongside 2% on cash balances held in an FDIC-insured checking account.\n\nFor growing mid-market companies, Ramp Plus costs $15 per user per month plus a platform fee based on team size (with 20% savings on annual billing). Ramp Plus adds multi-entity management, custom user roles, an audit log, AI expense reviews, procurement add-ons, and direct connections to NetSuite and Sage Intacct. Businesses that want cards, bill pay and cash yield in one account can start on Ramp Free without entering into an annual contract."
  },
